{"slug":"/students/subjects/english/mechanics-punctuation/punctuation/","source":"students/subjects/english/mechanics-punctuation/punctuation.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Punctuation — Mechanics","description":"","subject":"english","body":"<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/english/mechanics-punctuation/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to Mechanics</a></nav>\n    <article class=\"card p-6 rounded-lg\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Punctuation</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Rules for commas, semicolons, colons, apostrophes and quotation marks.</p>\n\n      <h2 class=\"font-semibold\">Worked example</h2>\n      <p class=\"mb-2\">Add commas: \"After the show we went home.\"</p>\n      <p class=\"mb-4\"><strong>Solution:</strong> \"After the show, we went home.\"</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Practice</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-5 mb-4 text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Insert commas: \"My brother who lives abroad is visiting.\"</li>\n        <li>Use apostrophe: show possessive for \"the girls book\"</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h4 class=\"font-semibold\">Brief answers</h4>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal pl-5 text-gray-700\">\n        <li>\"My brother, who lives abroad, is visiting.\"</li>\n        <li>\"the girl's book\"</li>\n      </ol>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Punctuation | English</title>\n  \n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n\n  <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/english/mechanics-punctuation/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to Mechanics &amp; Punctuation</a></nav>\n  <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Punctuation Rules</h1>\n  <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Guidelines for commas, semicolons and colons with examples.</p>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-50 to-orange-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.card{ -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}